OL,3,GNEWSAHeavy periods study to create
OL,4,Aworld's largest biobank
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major new research project aiming to
OL,7,Ftransform care for women with heavy
OL,8,Fperiods is to create the world's
OL,9,Flargest menstrual fluid biobank.
OL,11,FThe CycleTrack study hopes to improve
OL,12,Funderstanding of heavy menstrual
OL,13,Fbleeding and related conditions such as
OL,14,Fendometriosis and fibroids, helping
OL,15,Fspeed up diagnosis and treatment for
OL,16,Fmillions of women.
OL,18,FLed by researchers from the
OL,19,Funiversities of Bristol and Exeter, it
OL,20,Fwill collect real-time health data and
OL,21,Fmenstrual fluid samples from thousands
OL,22,Fof women across the UK.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
