OL,3,GNEWSAHeavy periods study to create
OL,4,Aworld's largest biobank
OL,5,
OL,6,FProfessor Gemma Sharp said the study
OL,7,Fwas going to be "a real game changer"
OL,8,Ffor menstrual health research and could
OL,9,Fcut waiting times for effective
OL,10,Ftreatment.
